---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="食用指南" slug="guide/" breadcrumb={[{label:'食用指南'}]}>
  <div class="page-title">
    <h1>🥄 食用指南</h1>
    <p>保定冰柿怎么吃？怎么买？怎么保存？一篇讲透</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7ed,#ffedd5);border-color:#fdba74;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">🍦 三步吃冰柿</h2>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;">
      <div style="text-align:center;padding:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:6px;">❄️</div>
        <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px;">第一步：取出</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.82rem;color:#666;">从冰箱冷冻室取出</div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:center;padding:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:6px;">⏱️</div>
        <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px;">第二步：静置</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.82rem;color:#666;">室温放置2-3分钟</div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:center;padding:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:6px;">🥄</div>
        <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px;">第三步：开吃</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.82rem;color:#666;">用勺子挖着吃！</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>👅 三重口感体验</h2>
    <p>保定冰柿的独特之处在于"一柿三吃"的层次感：</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>外层冰沙</strong> — 果肉冻结成绵密冰晶，清凉爽口，像冰沙般细滑</li>
      <li><strong>中心流心</strong> — 果胶自然析出，温润半流质，如冰激凌般柔滑</li>
      <li><strong>底部蜜浆</strong> — 浓缩天然糖分，甜而不腻，也可作为饮品基底</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>🧊 保存方法</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>温度：</strong>需在 <strong>-18°C</strong> 冷冻保存</li>
      <li><strong>保质期：</strong>可达 <strong>12 个月</strong></li>
      <li><strong>注意：</strong>避免反复解冻，吃多少取多少</li>
      <li>开封后请尽快食用完毕</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>🛒 购买渠道</h2>
    <p>目前保定冰柿已进驻以下渠道：</p>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;">
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:#faf9f8;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.9rem;">🏪 盒马鲜生（北京门店）</div>
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:#faf9f8;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.9rem;">🏪 北京七鲜超市</div>
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:#faf9f8;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.9rem;">🏪 北京物美超市</div>
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:#faf9f8;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.9rem;">🏪 欧亚集团（吉林）</div>
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:#faf9f8;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.9rem;">🛒 淘宝（品牌：独乐时光）</div>
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:#faf9f8;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.9rem;">🛒 电商平台陆续上架中</div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;color:#999;">北京、上海高端市场及香港特区已可购买，全国逐步铺货中。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef2f2,#fce4ec);border-color:#fecaca;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">⚡ 温馨提示</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>冰柿含天然果糖，糖尿病患者请适量食用</li>
      <li>对柿子过敏者请勿食用</li>
      <li>冰柿为冷冻甜品，请勿暴食以免肠胃不适</li>
      <li>儿童请在成人监护下食用</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
